  | ^^^^^^^^------------^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |         |
  |         unsatisfied requirement introduced here: `Params: FromPathArgs`
  = note: required for `(volga::Path<Params>,)` to implement `FromRequest`
